OL,3,GNEWSAMayor believes mass transit system
OL,4,Ais coming
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayor has said that Bristol deserves
OL,7,Fa mass transit system and hopes within
OL,8,Fthe next year more plans can be
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FHelen Godwin, mayor for the West of
OL,12,FEngland Combined Authority (Weca), made
OL,13,Fthe statement talking with John Darvall
OL,14,Fon BBC Radio Bristol's Hot Seat,
OL,15,Fanswering questions about public
OL,16,Ftransport, water supplies, and whether
OL,17,Fshe plans to become prime minister.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
