OL,3,GNEWSAMayor believes mass transit system
OL,4,Ais coming
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has indicated it will
OL,7,Fgive metro mayors more powers, and
OL,8,FNorth Somerset is due to join Weca,
OL,9,Fwhich covers Bristol, Yate and Bath, in
OL,10,Fthe coming months.
OL,12,FPlans for some sort of mass transit
OL,13,Fsystem have captured headlines after
OL,14,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham indicated
OL,15,Fhe was in favour of the idea.
